  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Mercy Ships: Partnering for Transformational Change - Strengthening Liberia&apos;s Surgical Health System 2021-2023</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Mercy Ships Norway&#x2019;s works to make a concentrated impact in Liberia by strategically focusing on strengthening the health system, specifically improving the availability, accessibility and quality of its surgical system by introducing best practice such as safe instrument use, safe anesthesia administration, readiness of vital equipment for a sterile and safe surgical environment, best practice care in the post-operative environment, and through training and mentoring of health workers in surgery, nursing care, and anesthesia. The project aims to improve maternal and neonatal health outcomes in Liberia, and it has a specific focus on safer anesthesia provision and resuscitation practices for neonatal and obstetric surgical patients.</narrative>
  </description>
